```text
# Naming Conventions

## Files
- React components: PascalCase (e.g., ChartContainer.tsx, Header.tsx)
- Hooks: camelCase with use prefix (e.g., useChartData.ts)
- Services/Utils: camelCase (e.g., api.ts, indicators.ts)
- Types: lowercase with .ts extension in types/ directory

## Components
- React components: PascalCase (e.g., function Header() {})
- Props interfaces: PascalCase with Props suffix (e.g., HeaderProps)

## CSS/Tailwind
- Custom classes: kebab-case (e.g., .chart-container)
- Tailwind arbitrary values: square brackets (e.g., w-[320px])

## API Routes
- RESTful naming: /api/resource/:id/action
- HTTP methods: GET for read, POST for create
